{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" %}
{#
  To the Yield: what a duel in progress means, for the two fighters and for anyone watching.
  Renders nothing unless a duel is being fought: TTY_Main sets TTY_Status only then.
  It sits after 0200_combat_status on purpose: that one tells a badly hurt NPC "every hit could be
  fatal", which is not true in a duel.
#}
{% set duel = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", "none", "TTY_Status", "") %}
{% if duel != "" %}
{% if papyrus_util("GetIntValue", npc.UUID, "TTY_Opponent", 0) == 1 %}
- You are fighting a formal duel with {{ player.name }} right now: real weapons, to the yield. Nobody is meant to die, whatever your wounds say. Keep words short, the way people talk mid-fight. If you are losing badly, yielding is no shame.
{% else %}
- {{ duel }} You are watching, not fighting: a short cheer, wince or remark at most, and do not join in.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{#
  NPC against NPC (TTY_NpcDuel). A challenge waiting on this NPC's answer comes first.
#}
{% if papyrus_util("GetIntValue", npc.UUID, "TTY_NpcChallenged", 0) == 1 %}
- ANSWER REQUIRED: {{ papyrus_util("GetStringValue", npc.UUID, "TTY_NpcChallengerName", "someone") }} has just challenged you to a formal duel: real weapons, to the yield, nobody dies. Answer now, in your own words: accept (AcceptDuel) or refuse (DeclineDuel).
{% endif %}
{#
  TTY_NpcStatus is set only while an NPC duel is being fought.
#}
{% set npcduel = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", "none", "TTY_NpcStatus", "") %}
{% if npcduel != "" %}
{% if papyrus_util("GetIntValue", npc.UUID, "TTY_NpcDuelist", 0) == 1 %}
- You are fighting a formal duel with {{ papyrus_util("GetStringValue", npc.UUID, "TTY_NpcDuelFoe", "your opponent") }} right now: real weapons, to the yield. Nobody is meant to die, whatever your wounds say. Keep words short, the way people talk mid-fight. If you are losing badly, yielding is no shame.
{% else %}
- {{ npcduel }} You are watching, not fighting: a short cheer, wince or remark at most, and do not join in.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
